      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on some new training docs for our customer success team. i got these raw transcripts from actual calls that we need to clean up so they look professional for the manual. can u look at this one and tell me what looks wrong or unpolished? i need to know what to edit out so it sounds more business-like.\n\ntranscript:\nCustomer: \"i been calling y'all for like three days now and nobody helping me. i be checking the app every morning but it still showing the same error. i need somebody to fix this right now cuz i'm tired of waiting.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
